title: Psalm 45: The King and His Bride
description: Psalm 45 in the King James Bible, the messianic wedding song: the pen of a ready writer, the King riding prosperously because of truth and meekness and righteousness, the oil of gladness and Christ the Anointed One, myrrh, aloes and cassia, and the bride brought to the King, from the Psalms series study.
output: lessons/bible/psalm-45.html
context: Psalm 45

